      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.5",
      "values:originalText": "Section 8 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of paragraphs (1) (a) and (1) (aa) \"and\";\n(b) by inserting after paragraph (1) (b) the following paragraph:\n\"(ba) the\nprovision\nof\nservices\nin\naccordance\nwith\narrangements entered into under subsection (1C) or\n(2A) and doing anything else included\nin the\narrangements that is incidental or conducive to the\nprovision of the services; and\";\n(c) by inserting in subsection (1C) \"and regulatory services\" after\n\"police services\";\n(d) by inserting after subsection (2A) the following subsection:\n\"(2B) Arrangements for the provision of services under\nsubsection (1A), (lc) or (2A) may include arrangements for the\ndoing of anything incidental or conducive to the provision of\nthe services.\".\nPowers and duties of members",
      "skos:definition": "Section 8 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of paragraphs (1) (a) and (1) (aa) \"and\";\n(b) by inserting after paragraph (1) (b) the following paragraph:\n\"(ba) the\nprovision\nof\nservices\nin\naccordance\nwith\narrangements entered into under subsection (1C) or\n(2A) and doing anything else included\nin the\narrangements that is incidental or conducive to the\nprovision of the services; and\";\n(c) by inserting in subsection (1C) \"and regulatory services\" after\n\"police services\";\n(d) by inserting after subsection (2A) the following subsection:\n\"(2B) Arrangements for the provision of services under\nsubsection (1A), (lc) or (2A) may include arrangements for the\ndoing of anything incidental or conducive to the provision of\nthe services.\".\nPowers and duties of members",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a26eb793bcd572ae8f57148eb02d1863e6c033ef6053c1c5a8c4dc52e92e5db2",
      "skos:note": "Amendments to Section 8 of the Principal Act regarding provision of services and regulatory services."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991#sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Section 4",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 5,
      "values:originalText": "Section 8 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of paragraphs (1) (a) and (1) (aa) \"and\";\n(b) by inserting after paragraph (1) (b) the following paragraph:\n\"(ba) the\nprovision\nof\nservices\nin\naccordance\nwith\narrangements entered into under subsection (1C) or\n(2A) and doing anything else included\nin the\narrangements that is incidental or conducive to the\nprovision of the services; and\";\n(c) by inserting in subsection (1C) \"and regulatory services\" after\n\"police services\";\n(d) by inserting after subsection (2A) the following subsection:\n\"(2B) Arrangements for the provision of services under\nsubsection (1A), (lc) or (2A) may include arrangements for the\ndoing of anything incidental or conducive to the provision of\nthe services.\".\nPowers and duties of members"
    },
