      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.5",
      "values:originalText": "Section 9 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of paragraph (1) (a) \"and\";\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\n(b) by inserting after paragraph (l)(ba) the following paragraph:\n\"(bb) when performing functions in an External Territory—\nthe powers and duties conferred or imposed on a\nconstable or an officer of police by or under any law\n(including the common law) of the Territory; and\".\nCommissioner and Deputy Commissioner",
      "skos:definition": "Section 9 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of paragraph (1) (a) \"and\";\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\n(b) by inserting after paragraph (l)(ba) the following paragraph:\n\"(bb) when performing functions in an External Territory—\nthe powers and duties conferred or imposed on a\nconstable or an officer of police by or under any law\n(including the common law) of the Territory; and\".\nCommissioner and Deputy Commissioner",
      "cml:asserts": [
