      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Section 21 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting \"or a Deputy Commissioner\";\n(b) by adding at the end the following subsection:\n\"(2) The Commissioner may grant leave of absence to a\nDeputy Commissioner on such terms and conditions as to\nremuneration or otherwise as the Commissioner determines.\".\nTermination of appointment",
      "skos:definition": "Section 21 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting \"or a Deputy Commissioner\";\n(b) by adding at the end the following subsection:\n\"(2) The Commissioner may grant leave of absence to a\nDeputy Commissioner on such terms and conditions as to\nremuneration or otherwise as the Commissioner determines.\".\nTermination of appointment",
      "cml:asserts": [
