    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 After section 26B of the Principal Act the following section is",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991#sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "inserted:\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\nMembers may be directed to perform certain staff member functions etc.\n\"26BA. The Commissioner may, at any time, in writing signed by\nthe Commissioner, direct a member who is a commissioned police\nofficer or a non-commissioned police officer to perform the specified\nfunctions and duties of a staff member during the period specified in\nthe direction, or until the direction is revoked.\".\nTerm of appointments",
      "skos:definition": "inserted:\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\nMembers may be directed to perform certain staff member functions etc.\n\"26BA. The Commissioner may, at any time, in writing signed by\nthe Commissioner, direct a member who is a commissioned police\nofficer or a non-commissioned police officer to perform the specified\nfunctions and duties of a staff member during the period specified in\nthe direction, or until the direction is revoked.\".\nTerm of appointments",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-11-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "815842c20741259cd98ab7d30d94a728771031ad3fa5cd00b58523afe3bb56fa",
      "skos:note": "Members may be directed to perform certain staff member functions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991#sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 After section 26B of the Principal Act the following section is",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "inserted:\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\nMembers may be directed to perform certain staff member functions etc.\n\"26BA. The Commissioner may, at any time, in writing signed by\nthe Commissioner, direct a member who is a commissioned police\nofficer or a non-commissioned police officer to perform the specified\nfunctions and duties of a staff member during the period specified in\nthe direction, or until the direction is revoked.\".\nTerm of appointments"
    },
    {
