      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "inserted:\nTransfers\n\"35A. Where a person is transferred, the person's appointment does\nnot end, but is, on and after the day when the transfer takes effect,\ntaken to be an appointment to the position within the rank, or at the\nlevel, to which the person is transferred.\".\nPromotion",
      "skos:definition": "inserted:\nTransfers\n\"35A. Where a person is transferred, the person's appointment does\nnot end, but is, on and after the day when the transfer takes effect,\ntaken to be an appointment to the position within the rank, or at the\nlevel, to which the person is transferred.\".\nPromotion",
      "cml:asserts": [
