      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Section 36 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting in\nsubsection (3) \"does not end, but\" after \"person's appointment\".\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\nReview by Merit Protection and Review Agency of non-appellable\npromotion decisions",
      "skos:definition": "Section 36 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting in\nsubsection (3) \"does not end, but\" after \"person's appointment\".\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\nReview by Merit Protection and Review Agency of non-appellable\npromotion decisions",
