    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-17",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "17 Section 17",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991#sec-17"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Section 36B of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nsubsections (8) and (8A) and substituting the following subsections:\n\"(8) Where a person's promotion is cancelled:\n(a) the person must, for all purposes, be treated as having held the\nposition to which he or she was promoted during the period\nbeginning when the promotion took effect and ending when it\nwas cancelled; and\n(b) on the cancellation, the Commissioner must transfer the person\nto a position of member or staff member, as the case requires,\nwithin a rank or at a level that is the same as, or equivalent to\nthe position and rank or level held by the person immediately\nbefore the promotion took effect.\n\"(8A) The Commissioner must create a position, or make a new\ndetermination under section 24, if it is necessary to do so in order to\ncomply with paragraph (8) (b) in a particular case.\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 36B of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nsubsections (8) and (8A) and substituting the following subsections:\n\"(8) Where a person's promotion is cancelled:\n(a) the person must, for all purposes, be treated as having held the\nposition to which he or she was promoted during the period\nbeginning when the promotion took effect and ending when it\nwas cancelled; and\n(b) on the cancellation, the Commissioner must transfer the person\nto a position of member or staff member, as the case requires,\nwithin a rank or at a level that is the same as, or equivalent to\nthe position and rank or level held by the person immediately\nbefore the promotion took effect.\n\"(8A) The Commissioner must create a position, or make a new\ndetermination under section 24, if it is necessary to do so in order to\ncomply with paragraph (8) (b) in a particular case.\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-17-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-17-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-17-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-17-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-17-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-17-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9bc526c0c135ad0feff4dada33443beca35c2103332aead9baa5f010b3a6bcf8",
      "skos:note": "A person must be treated as having held a position during a promotion period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991#sec-17",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17 Section 17",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Section 36B of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nsubsections (8) and (8A) and substituting the following subsections:\n\"(8) Where a person's promotion is cancelled:\n(a) the person must, for all purposes, be treated as having held the\nposition to which he or she was promoted during the period\nbeginning when the promotion took effect and ending when it\nwas cancelled; and\n(b) on the cancellation, the Commissioner must transfer the person\nto a position of member or staff member, as the case requires,\nwithin a rank or at a level that is the same as, or equivalent to\nthe position and rank or level held by the person immediately\nbefore the promotion took effect.\n\"(8A) The Commissioner must create a position, or make a new\ndetermination under section 24, if it is necessary to do so in order to\ncomply with paragraph (8) (b) in a particular case.\"."
    },
