      "values:originalText": "Section 16 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting \", a customs officer (other than the ComptrollerGeneral of Customs)\" after \"an AFP member\" in the definition\nof \"investigating officer\" in subsection (6);\n(b) by adding at the end of paragraphs (a) and (c) of the definition\nof \"relevant authority\" in subsection (6) \"or\";\n(c) by adding at the end of the definition of \"relevant authority\"\nin subsection (6) the following paragraph:\n\"(d) the Comptroller-General of Customs;\".\nSpecial provisions in relation to reports of suspect transactions",
      "skos:definition": "Section 16 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting \", a customs officer (other than the ComptrollerGeneral of Customs)\" after \"an AFP member\" in the definition\nof \"investigating officer\" in subsection (6);\n(b) by adding at the end of paragraphs (a) and (c) of the definition\nof \"relevant authority\" in subsection (6) \"or\";\n(c) by adding at the end of the definition of \"relevant authority\"\nin subsection (6) the following paragraph:\n\"(d) the Comptroller-General of Customs;\".\nSpecial provisions in relation to reports of suspect transactions",
