      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Section 26 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of paragraph (1) (a) \"or\";\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\n(b) by adding at the end of subsection (1) the following word and\nparagraph:\n\"; or (d) where the officer is a customs officer—the ComptrollerGeneral of Customs\".\nAccess to CTR information",
      "skos:definition": "Section 26 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of paragraph (1) (a) \"or\";\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\n(b) by adding at the end of subsection (1) the following word and\nparagraph:\n\"; or (d) where the officer is a customs officer—the ComptrollerGeneral of Customs\".\nAccess to CTR information",
