      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "Section 85ZL of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting after paragraph (b) of the definition of \"law\nenforcement agency\" the following paragraph:\n\"(ba) the Australian Customs Service;\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph (g) of the definition of \"law enforcement\nagency\" and substituting the following paragraph:\n\"(g) the New South Wales Crime Commission established\nunder the New South Wales Crime Commission Act\n1985 of New South Wales, or a similar body established\nunder a law of another State;\";\n(c) by omitting \"85ZP\" from the definition of \"spent\" and\nsubstituting \"85ZM\".\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991",
      "skos:definition": "Section 85ZL of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting after paragraph (b) of the definition of \"law\nenforcement agency\" the following paragraph:\n\"(ba) the Australian Customs Service;\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph (g) of the definition of \"law enforcement\nagency\" and substituting the following paragraph:\n\"(g) the New South Wales Crime Commission established\nunder the New South Wales Crime Commission Act\n1985 of New South Wales, or a similar body established\nunder a law of another State;\";\n(c) by omitting \"85ZP\" from the definition of \"spent\" and\nsubstituting \"85ZM\".\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-30-norm"
