      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "Section 6 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end\nthe following subsection:\n\"(2) Australia's accession to the Protocol is approved.\".\nOffences",
