      "values:originalText": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting in subsection (1) the following definition:\n\" 'Associate Director' means the Associate Director of Public\nProsecutions;\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph (4) (a) and substituting the following\nparagraphs:\n\"(a) the Associate Director; or\n(aa) a member of the staff mentioned in subsection 27 (1); or\n(ab) a person employed under subsection 27 (3); or\".\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\nOffice of the Director of Public Prosecutions",
      "skos:definition": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting in subsection (1) the following definition:\n\" 'Associate Director' means the Associate Director of Public\nProsecutions;\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph (4) (a) and substituting the following\nparagraphs:\n\"(a) the Associate Director; or\n(aa) a member of the staff mentioned in subsection 27 (1); or\n(ab) a person employed under subsection 27 (3); or\".\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment\nNo. 28, 1991\nOffice of the Director of Public Prosecutions",
