      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "Section 94 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nsubsection (3) \"2 months\" and substituting \"3 months\".\nSavings",
      "skos:definition": "Section 94 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nsubsection (3) \"2 months\" and substituting \"3 months\".\nSavings",
