      "values:originalText": "(3) This section does not prevent the Minister from revoking under\nsection 37 of the Principal Act, as amended by this Act, a declaration\nto which subsection (1) of this section applies.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) This section does not prevent the Minister from revoking under\nsection 37 of the Principal Act, as amended by this Act, a declaration\nto which subsection (1) of this section applies.",
