      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "As soon as this Protocol enters into force, it shall be registered\nby the Depositaries pursuant to Article 102 of the Charter of the United\nNations and pursuant to Article 83 of the Convention on International\nCivil Aviation (Chicago, 1944).\nArticle VII",
      "skos:definition": "As soon as this Protocol enters into force, it shall be registered\nby the Depositaries pursuant to Article 102 of the Charter of the United\nNations and pursuant to Article 83 of the Convention on International\nCivil Aviation (Chicago, 1944).\nArticle VII",
